#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:5
msgid "class WLAN -- control built-in WiFi interfaces"
msgstr "class WLAN -- styr inbyggda WiFi-gränssnitt"

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:7
msgid ""
"The :class:`WLAN` class drives the on-board WiFi radios on modern OpenMV "
"Cams. The same class wraps two different underlying drivers depending on the"
" board's WiFi MCU:"
msgstr ""
"Klassen :class:`WLAN` driver de inbyggda WiFi-radioenheterna på moderna "
"OpenMV Cam-kameror. Samma klass omsluter två olika underliggande drivrutiner"
" beroende på kortets WiFi-MCU:"

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:11
msgid ""
"**CYW43** (Infineon CYW43xxx Murata WiFi module). Used by the OpenMV Cam N6,"
" OpenMV Cam RT1062, Arduino Portenta H7, Arduino Nicla Vision and Arduino "
"Giga R1 WiFi."
msgstr ""
"**CYW43** (Infineon CYW43xxx Murata WiFi-modul). Används av OpenMV Cam N6, "
"OpenMV Cam RT1062, Arduino Portenta H7, Arduino Nicla Vision och Arduino "
"Giga R1 WiFi."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:14
msgid ""
"**NINA W10** (u-blox NINA-W10 / ESP32-WROOM). Used by the Arduino Nano "
"RP2040 Connect."
msgstr ""
"**NINA W10** (u-blox NINA-W10 / ESP32-WROOM). Används av Arduino Nano RP2040"
" Connect."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:17
msgid ""
"The two drivers expose the same method names but differ in a few arguments "
"and the set of accepted :meth:`config` keys. Differences are flagged below."
msgstr ""
"De två drivrutinerna exponerar samma metodnamn men skiljer sig åt i ett "
"fåtal argument och i uppsättningen accepterade :meth:`config`\\ -nycklar. "
"Skillnaderna markeras nedan."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:21
msgid ""
"The OpenMV cameras with a legacy WINC1500 WiFi shield (M4 / M7 / H7 / H7 "
"Plus / Pure Thermal) use :class:`WINC` instead."
msgstr ""
"OpenMV-kamerorna med en äldre WINC1500 WiFi-sköld (M4 / M7 / H7 / H7 Plus / "
"Pure Thermal) använder :class:`WINC` istället."

